{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk The Frog is a cozy, heartwarming point-and-click adventure with simple, unique drag-and-drop puzzle mechanics. Your task is to correctly assemble Froggo\u2019s world on sticky notes. You can solve the puzzles at your own pace and enjoy a gentle narrative journey with no stress or pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.poster.avif?t=1773245654\" width=848 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.webm?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.mp4?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Head home for the Froggapalooza festival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggo only wants one thing: to be back home at his pond so he can celebrate the start of spring with his friend Buddy. But along his path, he will encounter a lot of funny, sassy, and quirky characters who want his time and attention. Maybe they\u2019ll help him, too? Will he make it to the festival on time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.poster.avif?t=1773245654\" width=832 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.webm?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.mp4?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sort the world out</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level consists of an assortment of hand-drawn sticky notes. Your task is to piece them together correctly to create a path so Froggo can continue his journey and set his world to rights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle you solve is like a little moment of clarity; the mechanics are intuitive and accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get cozy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lovingly hand-drawn 2D style and ambient soundtrack create a heartwarming world where you can immerse yourself and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendship and hope</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snuggle up in your coziest blanket, brew a cup of your favorite tea, and get to know Froggo and his quirky new friends. Talk to each other, help one another, and work together to overcome an array of obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk The Frog invites you into a hopeful, emotional story of homecoming, friendship, and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.poster.avif?t=1773245654\" width=802 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.webm?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.mp4?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No timer, no stress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can take your time solving the puzzles on Froggo\u2019s journey home. Some encounters are optional, and some dialogues change nuances of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A narrative game that helps you unwind</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from your day-to-day and immerse yourself in a cozy puzzle adventure that doesn\u2019t push you; it gently takes you along on a journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggo is here to cheer you up when things get tough. Add Walk The Frog to your wishlist today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a touching story and humorous dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a world out of sticky notes and create the right path for Froggo and his friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, hand-drawn 2D visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story for young and old alike; the whole family can play together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Froggo as he meets funny, quirky friends, and work together to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, a fun use for sticky notes! No more boring to-do lists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different chapters: 1. The Forest, 2. The Insect City, 3. Fields and Meadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 18 levels made up of lots of lovingly illustrated sticky notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive drag-and-drop and point-and-click controls.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3336240?t=1773245654","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773245654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/3a83776a2a1898f34807ae2621b0aab336dd58ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773245654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/3a83776a2a1898f34807ae2621b0aab336dd58ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773245654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4028420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk The Frog is a cozy, heartwarming point-and-click adventure with simple, unique drag-and-drop puzzle mechanics. Your task is to correctly assemble Froggo\u2019s world on sticky notes. You can solve the puzzles at your own pace and enjoy a gentle narrative journey with no stress or pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.poster.avif?t=1773245654\" width=848 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.webm?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/1f6bcc99c950a2fd25ffe98b344d5222.mp4?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Head home for the Froggapalooza festival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggo only wants one thing: to be back home at his pond so he can celebrate the start of spring with his friend Buddy. But along his path, he will encounter a lot of funny, sassy, and quirky characters who want his time and attention. Maybe they\u2019ll help him, too? Will he make it to the festival on time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.poster.avif?t=1773245654\" width=832 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.webm?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/b4220498ebfd6d7ff85873bdde98a4e2.mp4?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sort the world out</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level consists of an assortment of hand-drawn sticky notes. Your task is to piece them together correctly to create a path so Froggo can continue his journey and set his world to rights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle you solve is like a little moment of clarity; the mechanics are intuitive and accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get cozy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lovingly hand-drawn 2D style and ambient soundtrack create a heartwarming world where you can immerse yourself and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendship and hope</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snuggle up in your coziest blanket, brew a cup of your favorite tea, and get to know Froggo and his quirky new friends. Talk to each other, help one another, and work together to overcome an array of obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk The Frog invites you into a hopeful, emotional story of homecoming, friendship, and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.poster.avif?t=1773245654\" width=802 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.webm?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/extras/07660ae27865595bea9531f0da06031d.mp4?t=1773245654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No timer, no stress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can take your time solving the puzzles on Froggo\u2019s journey home. Some encounters are optional, and some dialogues change nuances of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A narrative game that helps you unwind</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from your day-to-day and immerse yourself in a cozy puzzle adventure that doesn\u2019t push you; it gently takes you along on a journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggo is here to cheer you up when things get tough. Add Walk The Frog to your wishlist today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a touching story and humorous dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a world out of sticky notes and create the right path for Froggo and his friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, hand-drawn 2D visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story for young and old alike; the whole family can play together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Froggo as he meets funny, quirky friends, and work together to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, a fun use for sticky notes! No more boring to-do lists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different chapters: 1. The Forest, 2. The Insect City, 3. Fields and Meadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 18 levels made up of lots of lovingly illustrated sticky notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive drag-and-drop and point-and-click controls.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Walk The Frog"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336240/header.jpg?t=1773245654","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Walk The Frog \u00a9 2024 Walk The Frog UG (haftungsbeschr\u00e4nkt). All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 14.7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 14.7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3336240/1480976522/bed7d4f6024db4833921f48fcd73a859394307f1/1771973638/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771978340","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3336240/1480976522/bed7d4f6024db4833921f48fcd73a859394307f1/1771973638/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771978340","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3336240/1480976522/bed7d4f6024db4833921f48fcd73a859394307f1/1771973638/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771978340","id":257287823,"name":"Walk The Frog - Offical Demo Teaser 2026","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/